<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Illustration of cross-entropy and its decomposed components for different model sizes. Different rows correspond to different datasets. Only cross-entropy and Error-Entropy exhibit clear scaling behavior, with Error-Entropy lying closer to the fitted power-law line.
